#. えー、校内放送でーす。
msgctxt "0001 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ahmm...this is a school announcement."
msgstr ""

#. 夜になりました。
#. ゆっくり休んで、また明日も頑張っていきましょう。
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It is now officially nighttime. Get plenty of rest and\n"
"get ready to work hard again tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. ではでは、いい夢を。
#. おやすみなさい…
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay then...sweet dreams, everyone! Good night, sleep\n"
"tight, don't let the bed bugs bite..."
msgstr ""
"Thế thôi...mơ đẹp nhé, mọi người! Ngủ ngon, ngủ\n"
"tròn, đừng để lũ rệp rỉa mòn thịt da..."
